VanishGeo
=========

VanishGeo is a derivative work based on VanishMe:

  https://github.com/XiNian-dada/VanishMe

VanishMe is licensed under the MIT License. The original MIT License text is
preserved in LICENSE.

This derivative integrates selected capabilities from the local IP-Geolocation
project, including unified site configuration, allowlist resolution, dynamic
runtime injection, DNR Accept-Language rules, WebRTC policy handling, automatic
IP geolocation, diagnostics, fixtures, and regression tests.
